{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">容天佑早前在社交平台上載了一張與寶貝囡囡的溫馨合照，盡顯慈父魅力。照片中，他展現出溫柔又專業的新手爸爸本色，一手輕輕抱著愛女，另一隻手則拿著平板電腦專注地研讀劇本，畫面相當有愛。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">只見B女表情豐富、笑眼盈盈，可愛的模樣不但融化大批網民，囡囡陪著爸爸看劇本時的神情更是十分專注，更被不少人笑指她極具演戲天賦。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"10ebcba6-9509-4a25-9134-790e12d2a716.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026llbFvsd13b1786614666.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"10ebcba6-9509-4a25-9134-790e12d2a716.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"90fa7547-d804-4be6-a267-724453924953.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026pGaUXpXHKf1786614665.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"90fa7547-d804-4be6-a267-724453924953.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">除了分享父女溫馨日常，容天佑亦在帖文中向觀眾透露自己於13日播出的處境劇《愛·回家之三代同糖》中出場，呼籲大家多多留意及支持。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-17T05:19:47.951462+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":217,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}